<title>HONG KONG: Sterlite mandates US$70 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Sterlite mandates US$70 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterlite Industries (India) has mandated Union Bank of Switzerland to arrange a US$70 million floating rate note issue, UBS said on Friday.</p>
<p>The notes will mature in 10 years but can be put back to the issuer after seven years.</p>
<p>Roadshows will be held next week.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
